@startuml session_state
skinparam BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
    BorderColor #1565C0
    ArrowColor #0D47A1
    FontColor #000000
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFF9C4
    BorderColor #FBC02D
    FontColor #000000
}

title Logical Session Ownership State Machine

state "Prepared / Materialized" as PreparedMaterialized
state "Resume / Finalize" as ResumeFinalize
state "Active Owner" as ActiveOwner
state "Quiescing" as Quiescing
state "Stopped / Checkpointed" as StoppedCheckpointed
state "Replica" as Replica
state "Fenced (Stale)" as Fenced
state "Forked Session" as Forked

[*] --> PreparedMaterialized : Create Session
PreparedMaterialized --> ResumeFinalize : Resume Request / Acquire Lease
ResumeFinalize --> ActiveOwner : Finalize

ActiveOwner --> Quiescing : Graceful Takeover / Stop Request
Quiescing --> StoppedCheckpointed : Provider safe-turn stop
StoppedCheckpointed --> Replica : Source Demoted (After Dest Lease)

Replica --> PreparedMaterialized : Graceful Takeover (Prepare Materialization)
Replica --> PreparedMaterialized : Force Takeover (Prepare Materialization)
StoppedCheckpointed --> PreparedMaterialized : Local Resume

ActiveOwner --> Fenced : Lease stolen (Force Takeover)
Quiescing --> Fenced : Lease stolen
StoppedCheckpointed --> Fenced : Lease stolen
Fenced --> [*] : Preserves divergent history

ActiveOwner --> Forked : Fork
Replica --> Forked : Fork
Forked : New logical session identity

note right of ActiveOwner
  One deterministic winning active owner
  for the logical session. Stale/same-epoch
  losing leases do not permit another owner.
end note

note left of Replica
  Never allowed to resume
  without explicit handoff,
  force-takeover, or fork.
end note

@enduml
